        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MineDeeper</strong> gives the good old classic a whole new layer - two to be exact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find an <strong>endless</strong> amount of tiles to solve below the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving lower tiles also clears everything above - <strong>use all layers</strong> to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the harder it gets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how far you can get with caution and patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the clock and set new personal best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a heart for every 10th layer reached and tank your next misstep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How deep can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/25fdfe0d5d2dc26d6107482fa05a2203.poster.avif?t=1765648394\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/25fdfe0d5d2dc26d6107482fa05a2203.webm?t=1765648394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/25fdfe0d5d2dc26d6107482fa05a2203.mp4?t=1765648394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Achievements</strong> await to be unlocked, accompanied by <strong>unlockable backgrounds</strong> for each completed challenge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect 3 hearts, reach layer 100 or beat my personal best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your progress</strong> with your personal best times for reaching layer 10, 20, 30, 40 and 50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>tips and tricks</strong> in the &quot;How to Play&quot; section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>3 Save files</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is saved automatically</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your game with the following options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme: Light / Dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Accessibility</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parallax: on / off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer: Full / Simple / Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Particles: All / Reduced / Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font: Default / Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contrast: Low / Medium / High (possible to play in black and white)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse button rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard key rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input: Release / Same Tile / Press</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional settings to make inputs safer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give MineDeeper a try for yourself and let me know what you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MineDeeper</strong> gives the good old classic a whole new layer - two to be exact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find an <strong>endless</strong> amount of tiles to solve below the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving lower tiles also clears everything above - <strong>use all layers</strong> to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the harder it gets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how far you can get with caution and patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the clock and set new personal best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a heart for every 10th layer reached and tank your next misstep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How deep can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/25fdfe0d5d2dc26d6107482fa05a2203.poster.avif?t=1765648394\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/25fdfe0d5d2dc26d6107482fa05a2203.webm?t=1765648394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/25fdfe0d5d2dc26d6107482fa05a2203.mp4?t=1765648394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Achievements</strong> await to be unlocked, accompanied by <strong>unlockable backgrounds</strong> for each completed challenge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect 3 hearts, reach layer 100 or beat my personal best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your progress</strong> with your personal best times for reaching layer 10, 20, 30, 40 and 50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>tips and tricks</strong> in the &quot;How to Play&quot; section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>3 Save files</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is saved automatically</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your game with the following options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme: Light / Dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Accessibility</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parallax: on / off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer: Full / Simple / Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Particles: All / Reduced / Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font: Default / Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contrast: Low / Medium / High (possible to play in black and white)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse button rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard key rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input: Release / Same Tile / Press</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional settings to make inputs safer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give MineDeeper a try for yourself and let me know what you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>",
        "short_description": "MineDeeper gives Minesweeper a new layer. Find an endless amount of tiles to solve below the field. Solving these clears everything above as well! The deeper you go, the harder it gets - how deep can you go?",
